GLOS shell 1.0. HELP lists its commands.

[[C:\>]]
label
Volume in drive C is TESTDISK   
Volume Serial Number is 7107-1071
(KEY?)
Volume label (11 characters, ENTER for none)? (KEY ENTER)


Delete current volume label (Y/N)? (KEY?)
(KEY n)
N
[[C:\>]]
label c:newlab
(SETLABEL C: "NEWLAB")
[[C:\>]]
vol
